  "description": "Kubernetes catalogue provider for Bowire — reads Services from the Kubernetes API server (in-cluster service account or kubeconfig) and surfaces them through Bowire's IBowireCatalogueProvider seam (#136). Ships as a standalone NuGet so installs that don't run on Kubernetes don't pay any transitive weight: the provider talks to the API server over plain HTTP and pulls only Bowire core as a dependency.",
